    "description": {
      "content": "Hyperledger Besu is an Ethereum client written in Java that exposes a JSON-RPC 2.0 API over HTTP and WebSockets. The API provides namespaces including admin, debug, eth, net, web3, txpool, miner, and trace for interacting with Ethereum-compatible networks, smart contracts, and node operations.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Hyperledger Besu Community",
